---
// Campaign2Pivot.astro
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Before you upgrade your finance function, <br class="hidden md:block" />
      <span class="text-tally-600">find out where the gaps are.</span>
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Before changing your finance setup, let our CA-led team review your current books. We’ll identify accounting, reconciliation and compliance gaps and show you where your finance function needs attention.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#hero-form" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-tally-600 hover:bg-tally-700 text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-tally-600/30">
        Get My Free Books Health Check
      </a>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
